{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43021","headline":"长沙六快诗 · 王揆","name":"长沙六快诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"湖外风物奇，长沙信难续。\n衡峰排古青，湘水湛寒绿。\n舟檝通大江，车轮会平陆。\n昔贤官是邦，仁泽流丰沃。\n今贤官是邦，刳啗人脂肉。\n怀昔甘棠花，伤今猛虎毒。\n然此一郡内，所乐人才六。\n漕与二宪僚，守连两通属。\n高堂日暮会，深夜继以烛。\n帏幕皆绮纨，器皿尽金玉。\n歌喉若珠累，舞腰如素束。\n千态与万状，六人欢不足。\n因成快活诗，荐之尧舜目。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王揆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43021.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43021","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}